### Request 1: Successful request that returns a list (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/course-offerings

###

### Request 2: Successful request that returns one item (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/course-offerings/CO001

###

### Request 3: Request for an item that does not exist (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/course-offerings/CO999

###

### Request 4: Successful create request (201 Created)
